+/// Round 60: the same files must also number their people in file order. A battle save
+/// writes each unit's person as its number (Person+0x24, Person::SerializePointer 0044A54C)
+/// and Person::DeserializePointer (0044A62C) takes the record at (number - the first
+/// record's number) back: by position, not by number. Every file of the game numbers its
